  "label": "World War II",
  "description": "World War II (1939-1945) was a global conflict in which Nazi Germany, under Hitler, was a primary aggressor. The war resulted in unprecedented destruction and loss of life, including the Holocaust. The meme's context is rooted in this global conflict, and the reference to Hitler as a 'hero' is a direct affront to the historical understanding of his role as the instigator of a catastrophic war that led to the deaths of tens of millions.",
